{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S08、S11、S12等短停留段，话与感受交替出现得比较密，观众可能来不及细看全部内容；X的固定双栏布局在快速扫读上更省力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段最重要的心理落点，再用分时出现的小字把音乐变化与人物感受对应起来，观众更容易抓住重点，也能看到情绪如何一步步变化。尤其是从舍不得亲近、想起受过的气，到害怕孤单、拒绝委屈自己，再到带着想念继续生活，Y把人物内心的矛盾和转变交代得更完整。X更利落，但右侧感受词容易成为并列的信息集合，具体的情绪递进和音乐细节不如Y充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d1acdcfc-218c-42fe-bd4c-ad8233f43597", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T041153412449Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:13:23.001773+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "781bb0b892cd6d60558cefe50d83f93a8351c58779046ed5d425614b7acff2e0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at